{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>向來錫身的TVB小花戴祖儀罕有大解放！昨夜在IG大派福利，分享純白比堅尼泳衣照與性感短片。雪白肌膚配上甜美笑容，極具視覺震撼，令一眾網民狂呼噴血！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129578500777316352815760.jpeg/InjQK2yIUCX0ou4XoyWendwMCYxyG3IySdzx7knc8e4\" alt=\"戴祖儀忽然派福利po泳衣相。（IG@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀忽然派福利po泳衣相。（IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129578503394693120463851.jpeg/06KmtpCG-zQACJ8tbYCCuSY0enUQWVraHsFfVB7BX1Q\" alt=\"戴祖儀忽然派福利po泳衣相。（IG@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀忽然派福利po泳衣相。（IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure><p>嘆「少少emo」post泳衣相</p><p>不過，廣大網民粉絲有福啦！今日（5月8日）夜晚10點時段，戴祖儀竟然在Instagram「派福利」分享一小段短片和一張比堅尼泳衣照！雪白色的比堅尼泳衣加上藍天白雲，再加上戴祖儀雪白的肌膚和甜美笑容，又再加上一點點性感，不得了！實在令人噴血！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129579840257658880756143.png/aTJ-JwuOPDXvIzEOnMqVyLn6nUGrIBXujZl26I2Zdug\" alt=\"戴祖儀話有少少emo所以po泳衣相刷存在感。可唔可以emo多幾次？（ig圖片）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀話有少少emo所以po泳衣相刷存在感。可唔可以emo多幾次？（ig圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129580804800778240928156.jpeg/MBD0z-itEMlX5frGi_ehnO27mmK5Mhliguxz7ILsc-w\" alt=\"戴祖儀這個女僕造型曾在《粵講粵㜺鬼》中出現。（IG圖片）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀這個女僕造型曾在《粵講粵㜺鬼》中出現。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240108/821023530521989120537218.jpeg/CIAMB7Rq5liQ6PvDSmA9yuKfCG03ytbfDAa9HwwGvR8\" alt=\"戴祖儀都係出名擁有驕人美腿。（TVB圖片）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀都係出名擁有驕人美腿。（TVB圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231013/789467481218617344516820.jpeg/McXLq2DgCyMSlWeZhaMFNkbvwUBMf-3vAU7oIgFO6CI\" alt=\"戴祖儀（IG@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀（IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231013/789467495173722112761509.jpeg/mEq_1xcv1o9T8l4o2C_r2hwZaJO69BRb-WsYLvlrGC4\" alt=\"戴祖儀平日衣着較保守。（IG@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀平日衣着較保守。（IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250210/965472568243130368908165.jpeg/zb9AJ4Nm-PjNw28yUIIZhG4QpQQx2iiTORC-bzkQvm8\" alt=\"唱歌好聽又是學霸，最近更愈來愈靚。（IG@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>唱歌好聽又是學霸，最近更愈來愈靚。（IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231013/789467495266127872643215.jpeg/6NugGh9VevZZKJuu291XD7WYMxrGN1bDfXTPln10z5Y\" alt=\"戴祖儀（IG@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀（IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231013/789467498046951424435028.jpeg/9OucIyA2sXIG3cmzilxo2S_ICDQkysUS3EUR9NxFEfQ\" alt=\"戴祖儀（IG@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀（IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260321/1112006717178122240308647.jpeg/ciek7aiIyD-OmjiBghLty_CjMvIMt-QpL3C4QC9wuEA\" alt=\"戴祖儀渴望演古裝劇。（IG@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀渴望演古裝劇。（IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260423/1123993567698620416640587.jpeg/Vm4VrEbtDpmMIqPd-e6i0v7jM3GYRJ7IwbjR38G40d8\" alt=\"戴祖儀身穿條紋露臍裝，大曬腹肌。（ig@joeythyee）\"><figcaption>戴祖儀身穿條紋露臍裝，大曬腹肌。（ig@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T16:56:38.499873+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":527,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}